F;text-align:center;\">Free shipping over ₹599&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#E5E0D6;\">|</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Cash on delivery available&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#E5E0D6;\">|</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Questions? Just reply</p>"},{"type":"email","format":"designed","from_name":"Parth from PROMUNCH","delay_hours":21.25,"subject":"A quick note from PROMUNCH's founder","subject_variants":["{{first_name}}, can I ask you something?","Why I started PROMUNCH (30 second read)"],"preview_text":"Your cart is still saved, and your 15% code still works.","preview_variants":["What stopped you? Honest answers welcome."],"coupon":{"percent_off":15,"expires_in_days":3,"prefix":"CART15"},"coupon_code":"","body_html":"<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AF272F;\">A note from our founder</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;color:#1A1714;\">Can I ask you something?</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">Hi {{first_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">I'm Parth, founder of PROMUNCH. I noticed your cart is still sitting there, so I wanted to write to you myself.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">We started PROMUNCH because a snack in India usually meant fried namkeen or chips with very little protein. We wanted something crunchy that actually fills you up. That is what is waiting in your cart.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;li