hies are roasted, our Sticks and Chips are fried, and we always tell you which is which), and free shipping on orders over ₹599.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"border-left:3px solid #AF272F;padding:4px 0 4px 16px;\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:2px;color:#AF272F;\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><div style=\"font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;font-style:italic;color:#1A1714;\">&ldquo;Wish this was mainstream. Excellent flavour, excellent crunch, excellent macros. What more do you want?&rdquo;</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#4A453F;\">Sujay Thomas, on Noodle Masala Soya Crunchies</div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A453F;text-align:center;\">Free shipping over ₹599&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#E5E0D6;\">|</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Cash on delivery available&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#E5E0D6;\">|</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Questions? Just reply</p>"},{"type":"email","format":"designed","from_name":"Parth from PROMUNCH","delay_hours":24,"subject":"A quick note from PROMUNCH's founder","subject_variants":["{{first_name}}, a little something from our founder","15% off {{product.title}}, from me"],"preview_text":"I saw you looking at {{product.title}}. Here is 15% off it.","preview_variants":["A personal note, and 15% off just for you."],"coupon":{"percent_off":15,"expires_in_days":3,"prefix":"LOOK15"},"coupon_code":"","body_html":"<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AF272F;\">A note from our founder</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;color:#1A1714;\">Here is 15% off, from me</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">Hi {{first_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">I'm Parth, founder of PROMUNCH. I saw you looking at <strong>{{product.title}}</strong>, so I wanted to write to you myself.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">We started PROMUNCH because a snack in India usually meant fried namkeen or chips with very little protein. We wanted something crunchy that actually fills you up, and we are honest about how each one is made: our Edamame is roasted in olive oil, our Soya Crunchies are roasted, and our Sticks and Chips are fried.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">Not sure about a flavour? <strong>Just hit reply</strong> and tell me what you like, spicy, tangy or light and salty, and I will point you to the right pack. To make it easy to try, here is 15% off, just for you.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:20px 0 8px;\"><tr><td width=\"76\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:76px;padding:0 14px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://admin.promunch.in/email/parth-headshot.jpg\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Parth Mutha\" style=\"display:block;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:32px;border:2px solid #AF272F;object-fit:cover;\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#1A1714;\"><strong>Parth Mutha</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#4A453F;\">Founder, PROMUNCH</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#AF272F;\">Forbes 30 Under 30 Asia 2025</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E0D6;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table>{{product_card}}<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#F4F1EA\" style=\"background:#F4F1EA;border:2px dashed #AF272F;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-family:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:400;color:#1A1714;\">Your 15% off code</div><div style=\"margin:10px 0 6px;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;color:#AF272F;\">{{coupon_code}}</div><div style=\"font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A453F;\">One use only. Valid for 3 days.</div></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#AF272F\" align=\"center\" style=\"background:#AF272F;border:2px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;\"><a href=\"{{product.url}}\" style=\"display:block;text-align:center;padding:18px 20px;font-family:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:14px;\">Get it for 15% off</a></td></tr></table>"},{"type":"email","format":"designed","delay_hours":48,"subjec