</table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#AF272F\" align=\"center\" style=\"background:#AF272F;border:2px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;\"><a href=\"https://promunch.in/collections/best-sellers?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=flow&amp;utm_campaign=welcome&amp;utm_content=email_1\" style=\"display:block;text-align:center;padding:18px 20px;font-family:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:14px;\">Shop Best Sellers</a></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E0D6;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AF272F;\">Why we started PROMUNCH</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:4px 0 20px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://admin.promunch.in/email/parth-forbes.jpg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Parth Mutha, founder of PROMUNCH, at the Forbes Under 30 Summit Asia\" style=\"display:block;width:400px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:14px;\"><div style=\"font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A453F;margin-top:8px;text-align:center;\">Me at the Forbes Under 30 Summit Asia in Bangkok</div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">Hi, I'm Parth. Walk down any snack aisle in India and you will find plenty of savoury snacks, but almost none that give you real protein. Most are fried namkeen and chips that taste great for ten minutes and do nothing for your body.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">I started PROMUNCH in 2021 to fix that: savoury, crunchy snacks with serious protein in every pack. Our Roasted Edamame packs <strong>42 to 45g of protein per 100g</strong>. In 2025, building it put me on the <strong>Forbes 30 Under 30 Asia</strong> list, but the best part is still hearing from people who finally found a snack they do not feel guilty about.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\"><strong>My promise to you:</strong> real protein, honest labels (our Edamame is roasted in olive oil, our Soya Crunchies are roasted, our Sticks and Chips are fried, and we always tell you which is which), and free shipping on orders over ₹599.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E0D6;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">One small thing: add <strong>hello@promunch.in</strong> to your contacts so our emails, and your code, land in your inbox and not in spam.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 20px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A453F;margin:0 0 6px;\">Follow the crunch <b style=\"color:#1A1714;\">@promunch.snacks</b></div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/promunch.snacks\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:4px 6px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">Instagram</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/promunch.snacks\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:4px 6px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">Facebook</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PromunchYourMunchyPal\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:4px 6px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">YouTube</a></td></tr></table>"},{"type":"email","format":"designed","from_name":"Parth from PROMUNCH","delay_hours":48,"subject":"Not sure what to try first? Here is my pick","subject_variants":["{{first_name}}, which PROMUNCH is right for you?","A quick guide from our founder"],"preview_text":"Pick by what you are in the mood for. Your 15% code is still active.","preview_variants":["Most protein, namkeen crunch or chip cravings? Start here."],"coupon":{"percent_off":15,"expires_in_days":9,"prefix":"WELCOME15"},"coupon_code":"","body_html":"<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AF272F;\">A note from our founder</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;color:#1A1714;\">Not sure what to try first?</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">Hi {{first_name}}, 