rotein-snack-no-added-sugar-rich-in-fiber-roasted-in-olive-oil-gluten-free?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=flow&amp;utm_campaign=welcome&amp;utm_content=email_5\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0794/6731/5501/files/HRS_Pack_of_3.jpg?v=1781850238\" alt=\"Himalayan Rock Salt Roasted Edamame\" width=\"170\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:170px;height:auto;border:1px solid #E5E0D6;border-radius:14px;\"></a><div style=\"margin-top:10px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;\"><a href=\"https://promunch.in/products/promunch-roasted-edamame-beans-himalayan-rock-salt-45g-high-protein-snack-no-added-sugar-rich-in-fiber-roasted-in-olive-oil-gluten-free?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=flow&amp;utm_campaign=welcome&amp;utm_content=email_5\" style=\"color:#1A1714;text-decoration:underline;\">Himalayan Rock Salt Roasted Edamame</a></div></div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A453F;text-align:center;\">Free shipping over ₹599&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#E5E0D6;\">|</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Cash on delivery available&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#E5E0D6;\">|</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Questions? Just reply</p>"}]$j$::jsonb, 'draft'
