#9733;</a><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 4px;font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">&#9733;</a><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 4px;font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">&#9733;</a><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 4px;font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">&#9733;</a><div style=\"font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A453F;margin-top:8px;\">Tap the stars to leave your rating</div></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#AF272F\" align=\"center\" style=\"background:#AF272F;border:2px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;\"><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:block;text-align:center;padding:18px 20px;font-family:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:14px;\">Leave a review</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">Something not right? <strong>Reply to this email</strong> instead and we will fix it. And if you snapped a photo, tag us on Instagram.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 20px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A453F;margin:0 0 6px;\">Follow the crunch <b style=\"color:#1A1714;\">@promunch.snacks</b></div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/promunch.snacks\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:4px 6px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">Instagram</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/promunch.snacks\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:4px 6px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">Facebook</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PromunchYourMunchyPal\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:4px 6px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">YouTube</a></td></tr></table>"},{"type":"email","format":"designed","from_name":"Parth from PROMUNCH","delay_hours":96,"skip_if_wa_journey":"review","subject":"One small favour, {{first_name}}?","subject_variants":["Would you rate your {{review_product}}?","A minute of your time?"],"preview_text":"A quick review helps a small brand a lot.","preview_variants":["Parth here, one quick ask."],"body_html":"<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AF272F;\">A note from our founder</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;color:#1A1714;\">One small favour?</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">Hi {{first_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">Parth here, founder of PROMUNCH. If you have a minute, would you leave a quick review of your <strong>{{review_product}}</strong>? Reviews are how new snackers find us, and honest ones, good or bad, help us get better.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:20px 0 8px;\"><tr><td width=\"76\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:76px;padding:0 14px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://admin.promunch.in/email/parth-headshot.jpg\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"Parth Mutha\" style=\"display:block;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:32px;border:2px solid #AF272F;object-fit:cover;\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#1A1714;\"><strong>Parth Mutha</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#4A453F;\">Founder, PROMUNCH</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#AF272F;\">Forbes 30 Under 30 Asia 2025</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E0D6;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:4px 0 20px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 4px;font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">&#9733;</a><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 4px;font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">&#9733;</a><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 4px;font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">&#9733;</a><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 4px;font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">&#9733;</a><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 4px;font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#AF272F;text-decoration:none;\">&#9733;</a><div style=\"font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A453F;margin-top:8px;\">Tap the stars to leave your rating</div></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#AF272F\" align=\"center\" style=\"background:#AF272F;border:2px solid #AF272F;border-radius:14px;\"><a href=\"{{review_url}}\" style=\"display:block;text-align:center;padding:18px 20px;font-family:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:14px;\">Leave a review</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Assistant,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1714;\">Already did it? Thank you, you can ignore this email.</p>"}]$j$::jsonb, 'draft'
